open-voicetyping (1.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package release
  * Voice typing system with GNOME Shell extension
  * Two-service architecture for privilege separation
  * Support for OpenAI Whisper and Groq APIs
  * Features:
    - Real-time audio recording with keyboard shortcuts
    - Automatic transcription and text insertion
    - GNOME Shell 47+ integration with panel indicator
    - Secure keyboard simulation via /dev/uinput

